From 228b72b7835e0d79ea263a2c023b83f3bb63d873 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:15:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD clean-review confirmation prompts so patch-agent
 chats close only after user consent

Clean automatic reviews append a yes/no completion question to the reviewed patch-agent chat. A positive answer records that the feature chat is closed until later user chat reopens it, while negative or follow-up text keeps the patch agent available for more work. Numbered repeat prompts keep append-oriented terminal caches visibly updated for later clean review passes.
